// Cross-checks indicators against TA-Lib 0.8.3 reference outputs using the
// same two seeded 300-bar datasets (`talibWalk.csv` and `talibTicks.csv`)
// generated by github.com/cinar/indicator's `internal/talibcompat`.
//
// Indicators intentionally omitted here due to known differences also tracked
// in github.com/cinar/indicator:
// - cfo / mcfo (FOSC uses 1-bar-lagged TSF, cinar/indicator#530)
// - slope (2-point secant vs LINEARREG_SLOPE, cinar/indicator#531)
// - superTrend (HMA-smoothed ATR vs Wilder ATR, cinar/indicator#527)
// - kc (middle EMA on close vs typical price, cinar/indicator#528)
// - ce (first-seeded ATR(22) still has ~2e-6 residue at bar 300)
// - kvo (simplified volume force without closings, cinar/indicator#529)
// - obv (starts at 0 vs TA-Lib's volumes[0] offset)
// - dc (operates on closings vs TA-Lib's highs/lows)

